{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act12side_level_act12side_03_end",
  "groupId": "act12side",
  "stageId": "act12side_03",
  "title": "Timely Assistance",
  "storyCode": "DH-3",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "eca1389a139c293f64bb437b63bfc9fde191f4fd13210b3f45e9857fb82fdbc3",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This is phenomenal work! Ch'en snuck into an alley to save the trapped Mizuki, and followed it by directly confronting all the other competitors there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It seems the other teams have determined LUNG wRATh is too dangerous to keep around, and have all silently accorded to work together."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But even so, Ch'en isn't cowed one bit, choosing to take up the fight."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A battle to absolutely revel in!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But we can't forget about the other side of the alley, where Lin battles too!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Unlike Ch'en's teeth-gritting clash in the alleyway, Lin's spared only a few moves to hold down the entrance, and deter any team who dares come."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is there anyone in this whole championship who can overcome this combination's mere presence?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ha ha, goes to show they do work when they each fight their own."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey, Missy, if Ch'en and Miss Lin fought, who do you think'd win?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm interested, y'know. Put two really powerful guys together, and who wouldn't wanna know who the stronger is."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Only you'd think like that!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I wouldn't know anyway. It's the first time I've seen this woman fight in years."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Huh? Weren't you and Miss Lin buddy-buddy? Weird you never got to see this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Who's buddies with who? She plays at that mystery, 24/7. There's times she doesn't even answer the phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And who says you've seen someone fight just 'cause you know them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's fair enough, I guess that's just me being used to Ch'en. If she wanted to win now, I'd be out of luck banking on just her swordplay."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Not everyone's got the same dynamic as you two."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Besides, it's a good thing I haven't seen it. I worry the day I do, I'll be trying to arrest her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Makes sense. She's the Rat King's daughter, after all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Eh, still can't say so, though. He's not a bad egg or anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "When I was a fresh dumbass in Lungmen..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Save it. I've met the Rat King before, you know. I don't need you telling me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey, as long as you get it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Forget that, you just used the word 'dumbass,' didn't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Look at me, using vulgar language in front of Milady. Oughta slap me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hmph."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So you and Ch'en have seen how she takes fights?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "C'mon, I'm here because I haven't. Neither has Ch'en, I reckon."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're right about one thing, though. It's a good thing we've never seen her fight before. That'd put us in the tough position, we'd have to take her in."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "As long as you get it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Never thought there'd be a day when she and Ch'en work together, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You really do see everything as you get older."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So in the end, who do you think would win, then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't feel like guessing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Heh, then I'll guess on my own."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "In my opinion, if Ch'en had her sword, it'd be hard for Lin Yühsia to ever get near her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But, if she does let Miss Lin get near, then Ch'en's lost."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ch'en sure sucks."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You can't say that either. Ch'en's solid with her kickboxing. Joint locks and grapples and whatever. She's amazing with all our normal training, too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You saw how decent her accuracy was too, just now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But in the end, Ch'en's best with a sword."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So you're implying Lin Yühsia's as good in close-quarters as Ch'en is with her sword."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "More or less."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Having fun acting the hero, Hui-chieh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Not really, but I don't need you worrying."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ernesto",
      "speakerToken": "avg_486_espumo_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sorry, Miss Ch'en, I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I told you, you could've just waited over there for me. You did fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mizuki",
      "speakerToken": "avg_437_mizuki_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Thank you for helping me out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're welcome."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mizuki",
      "speakerToken": "avg_437_mizuki_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But, um, why did you do it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No reason. I saw you, so I helped."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mizuki",
      "speakerToken": "avg_437_mizuki_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I see. You're a nice person, Miss."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mizuki",
      "speakerToken": "avg_437_mizuki_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And since you're nice, here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ernesto",
      "speakerToken": "avg_486_espumo_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is this... pure gold?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mizuki",
      "speakerToken": "avg_437_mizuki_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mhm, they were only after me because I had this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ernesto",
      "speakerToken": "avg_486_espumo_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And you're fine giving it to us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mizuki",
      "speakerToken": "avg_437_mizuki_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's alright, I can go look for some more."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mizuki",
      "speakerToken": "avg_437_mizuki_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Besides, I never really cared about the competition anyway. Getting to know someone as nice as Miss Ch'en is enough for me already."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'll give you a heads-up. Quite a few teams are on high alert—you can chat all you want, but you'd better not stay here too long."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mizuki",
      "speakerToken": "avg_437_mizuki_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm heading off, then. Bye-bye~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We'd better move too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Can I just ask, did you get anything out of that other than playing hero?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Does gold not count?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I guess."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What about you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Nothing in particular."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So, continue? Or hand in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We'll continue."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alright, dear audience. I've just gotten word that all twenty pure gold ingots have been handed in."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Which means, Round 1 has reached a consummate close."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now, then, we'll move to the voting phase."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Voting will last several hours, and once it closes, we'll be here on stage announcing the teams that made it out of Round 1! Don't miss it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...It's over."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ernesto",
      "speakerToken": "avg_486_espumo_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There's still Round 1 voting, but with your popularity, I'm sure we'll be fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ernesto",
      "speakerToken": "avg_486_espumo_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That said, it seems you haven't gotten leads on any dangerous terrorists, Miss Lin?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Not on my end."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ernesto",
      "speakerToken": "avg_486_espumo_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then maybe there really isn't anything to worry about."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Possibly."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hui-chieh, do you have a moment?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "For what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I need you for something."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
